        "label": "04. Cancelled main hearings in criminal cases at district courts by Court, Cause of cancelled hearing and Year",
        "source": "The Swedish National Courts Administration",
        "updated": "2026-03-10T08:30:00Z",
        "note": [
          "The table illustrates the number of  cancelled main hearings by cause in criminal cases at district courts. Cancelled main hearings only include main hearings that was cancelled due to inconvenient causes."
        ],
        "role": {
